//
// - A list item stays exactly as written even when it is long enough to exceed the formatter width by far.
// ms: status 99 EXAMPLE a data comment that is long enough to exceed the formatter width but must never be reflowed
fn f() Int:
	// A `code span` stays whole when the line wraps, so inline code is never split across two lines of text.
